#: ../../source/api/cli/case-analysis.md:1 d92f10049fb14a1b9841c8deac22c828
msgid "case_analysis.py 命令行参考"
msgstr "case_analysis.py Command Line Reference"

#: ../../source/api/cli/case-analysis.md:3 9b6e502a67f444ca86cfca726530e17e
msgid "`case_analysis.py` 提供了面向已训练模型的细粒度学生个案推断、代表性样本筛选以及知识状态轨迹热力图渲染管线。"
msgstr ""
"`case_analysis.py` provides a pipeline for fine-grained student case "
"inference, representative sample selection, and knowledge state "
"trajectory heatmap rendering on trained models."

#: ../../source/api/cli/case-analysis.md:5 1ba6d85ec0b54f5683c9527b8b63711e
msgid "工作流分为三个标准步骤："
msgstr "The workflow consists of three standard steps:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/case-analysis.md:7 1842e8314cfc420792c6ad51a5ef487e
msgid ""
"**`inference`**：全量前向推断，生成 `predictions.parquet` 与 "
"`user_summaries.parquet`。"
msgstr ""
"**`inference`**: Full forward inference, generating `predictions.parquet`"
" and `user_summaries.parquet`."

#: ../../source/api/cli/case-analysis.md:8 79455d7eccc141ddb9df6262d2f7fbc9
msgid "**`select`**：按策略筛选代表性学生，输出 `selected_users.json`。"
msgstr ""
"**`select`**: Select representative students by strategy, outputting "
"`selected_users.json`."

#: ../../source/api/cli/case-analysis.md:9 b315946f854c4ecb9cba1ad4084c1a8d
msgid "**`plot`**：绘制单个学生的知识状态时序热力图，输出 PNG 图像。"
msgstr ""
"**`plot`**: Render sequential heatmaps of knowledge states for individual"
" students, outputting PNG images."

#: ../../source/api/cli/case-analysis.md:13 6acf0e4f6e954a63b5936eddbf3b6b25
msgid "步骤 1：运行模型推断 (`inference`)"
msgstr "Step 1: Run Model Inference (`inference`)"

#: ../../source/api/cli/case-analysis.md:15 1a10d58da52b4db5b2a2c47b5058f468
msgid "加载已训练模型的检查点，执行推断并将各时刻的预测概率、真实标签与掌握度状态持久化到磁盘。"
msgstr ""
"Load checkpoints of trained models, execute inference, and persist "
"prediction probabilities, ground truth labels, and mastery states across "
"all time steps to disk."

